# Claude Code per-machine runtime state living under <repo>/.claude/.
# settings.json is a rendered output (configs/claude/ -> `just
# hooks-render`), mirroring how .codex/hooks.json renders from
# configs/codex/; both are gitignored because spawn-time injection
# rewrites them kind-scoped. Tracked: settings.local.json (operator
# overrides). Ignored: everything else Claude writes here.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.local.json

